[0.435821, "o", "usage: transcript-label-trainer [-h] [--training-root PATH]\r\n                                [--storage-root PATH]\r\n                                {train,run,evaluate,infer,info,autolabel} ...\r\n\r\nTrain small local classifiers that predict Transcript Lake aspect labels, and\r\nemit label suggestions. Never writes to the lake.\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  {train,run,evaluate,infer,info,autolabel}\r\n    train               train a classifier for one aspect\r\n    run                 execute a declarative training job (YAML spec)\r\n    evaluate            score a trained model on its frozen holdout and have a\r\n                        Brama teacher judge whether the predictions are\r\n                        acceptable\r\n    infer               emit label suggestions for unlabeled sessions\r\n    info                list trained aspects, artifacts, and metrics\r\n    autolabel           label every unlabeled session for an aspect via a\r\n                        Brama teacher (zero-touch)\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help            sho"]
[0.435847, "o", "w this help message and exit\r\n  --training-root PATH  override where model artifacts live; beats $TLT_HOME\r\n                        and the Stado registry declaration\r\n  --storage-root PATH   override the lake data root; beats $LAKE_DATA and the\r\n                        Stado registry declaration\r\n"]
[0.436469, "o", "wisent-ref$ "]
